/*!
    \page whatsnew611.html
    \title What's New in Qt 6.11
    \ingroup whatsnewqt6
    \brief Lists the new features in Qt 6.11.
    \meta sortkey 611

    \section1 New Modules in Qt 6.11

    Qt 6.11 adds the following modules:

    \list
      \li \l {Qt Canvas Painter} - Accelerated 2D painting solution for Qt Quick
          and QRhi-based render targets.
      \li \l {Qt OpenAPI} - An extension of the upstream Open API generator that
          generates Qt HTTP clients, typically used for RESTful APIs.
      \li \l {Qt TaskTree} - Provides a declarative way to compose and execute
          asynchronous task workflows.
    \endlist

    The new modules are in \e{Technical Preview}, excluding their API from
    \l{Compatibility promises}{Qt's compatibility promises}.

    \section1 New Features in Qt 6.11

    \section2 Qt CoAP Module
    \list
      \li \l QCoapClient::bindInterface allows to bind the communication to a specific
          network interface.
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Core Module
    \list
      \li \l QDate is now weakly incrementable, i.e. implements pre- and post-fix increment
          (and decrement) operators, and can be used in a C++20 \c{std::views::iota}.
      \li \l QJniObject APIs can now be called with \c{std::expected} (or an equivalent type)
          as the return type, in which case Java exceptions are not consumed by the framework
          and instead passed back to the caller as the unexpected result.
      \li \l QRangeModel::ItemAccess provides a customization point for accessing role data
          of a multi-role item type.
      \li \l QRangeModel can now be used with C++ ranges that don't provide a constant
          \c{std::begin/end} implementation, such as C++20 \c{std::views::filter}.
      \li With ranges that use the same QObject subclass for multi-role items, the new
          \l QRangeModel::autoConnectPolicy can be set to Full or OnRead to connect the
          changed-signals of all exposed properties of QObject items to the corresponding
          \l {QAbstractItemModel::}{dataChanged()} signal emission.
      \li \l QRangeModelAdapter provides a typical C++ container API to the range a QRangeModel
          operates on, ensuring that relevant QAbstractItemModel signals are emitted on
          changes, without user code having to work with QModelIndex. This new class is under
          technology preview.
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt DBus Module
    \list
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Graphs Module
    \list
      \li Added new \l{QCustomSeries} class to allow users to create their own 2D graph
          types, such as candlestick or box-plot graphs
      \li Added multi-axis support to 3D graphs in the form of
          \l{QBar3DSeries::rowAxis}{rowAxis}, \l{QBar3DSeries::valueAxis}{valueAxis}, and
          \l{QBar3DSeries::columnAxis}{columnAxis} properties in \l{QBar3DSeries}, and
          \l{QScatter3DSeries::axisX}{axisX}, \l{QScatter3DSeries::axisY}{axisY}, and
          \l{QScatter3DSeries::axisZ}{axisZ} properties in \l{QScatter3DSeries} and
          \l{QSurface3DSeries}
      \li Added \l{QPieSlice::subSlicesCount}{subSlicesCount},
          \l{QPieSlice::subSlicesSum}{subSlicesSum},
          \l{QPieSlice::subSlicesRatio}{subSlicesRatio}, and
          \l{QPieSlice::sliceChildren}{sliceChildren} properties in \l{QPieSlice} to allow
          creating sub slices in pie and donut graphs
      \li Added \l{QDateTimeAxis::visualMin}{visualMin} and
          \l{QDateTimeAxis::visualMax}{visualMax} properties in \l{QDateTimeAxis} and
          \l{QValueAxis} to hold the visible axis ranges
      \li Added \l{QAreaSeries::gradient}{gradient} and
          \l{QAreaSeries::selectedGradient}{selectedGradient} properties in \l{QAreaSeries}
          to allow using gradients in area graphs
      \li Added \l{QBarCategoryAxis::labelPosition}{labelPosition} property in
          \l{QBarCategoryAxis} to allow adjusting the label placement in bar graphs
      \li Added \l{QDateTimeAxis::timeZone}{timeZone} property in \l{QDateTimeAxis} to allow
          setting your own time zone for the axis
      \li Added \l{QDateTimeAxis::pan}{pan} and \l{QDateTimeAxis::zoom}{zoom} properties
          in \l{QDateTimeAxis} to allow panning and zooming the same way as in \l{QValueAxis}
      \li Added \l{QAbstractAxis::color}{color} and \l{QAbstractAxis::subColor}{subColor}
          properties in \l{QAbstractAxis} to allow overriding theme colors for the axes
      \li Added \l{QLineSeries::joinStyle}{joinStyle}, \l{QLineSeries::lineStyle}{lineStyle},
          \l{QLineSeries::strokeStyle}{strokeStyle}, \l{QLineSeries::dashOffset}{dashOffset},
          and \l{QLineSeries::dashPattern}{dashPattern} properties in \l{QLineSeries} to
          allow further styling in line graphs
      \li Added \l{QSplineSeries::optimized}{optimized} property in \l{QSplineSeries} to
          allow using Catmull-Rom interpolation instead of the more performance-heavy and
          accurate default method
      \li Added \l{QBar3DSeries::customRowLabels}{customRowLabels} and
          \l{QBar3DSeries::customColumnLabels}{customColumnLabels} properties in
          \l{QBar3DSeries} to allow overriding row and column labels
      \li Added \l{QCustom3DItem::rotationAbsolute}{rotationAbsolute} property in
          \l{QCustom3DItem} to fix problems in custom item rotations
      \li Added \l{QSurface3DSeries::rowsSanitized}{rowsSanitized} property in
          \l{QSurface3DSeries} to automatically remove rows with invalid data
      \li Added \l{GraphsItem3D::cutoffMargin}{cutoffMargin} in \l{GraphsItem3D}
          and \l{Q3DGraphsWidgetItem} to adjust the sensitivity of culling items near graph
          margins
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt GRPC Module
    \list
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt GUI Module
    \list
        \li Accessibility events of the new QAccessible::RoleChange type get emitted by the
            docking window framework when dock widgets change between docked and floating.
        \li The new accessibility role \l{QAccessible::Role}{Switch} is used by the Switch
            type in Qt Quick Controls.
        \li The new accessible attribute \l {QAccessible::Attribute}{Orientation} is used by
            sliders and similar controls to report their orientation to accessibility clients.
        \li QRawFont got an API to get the \l {QRawFont::}{glyphCount()} and to look up the
            \l {QRawFont::}{glyphName()} for a glyph index of the font.
        \li QTextCharFormat got new APIs to set \l {QTextCharFormat::setFontFeatures()}
            {font features} and \l {QTextCharFormat::setFontVariableAxes()}{variable axes}.
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt HttpServer Module
    \list
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Lottie Animation
    \list
      \li Added support for path fill rules.
      \li Added CMAKE command \l{qt_target_qml_from_lottie()} for converting from Lottie to QML at
          build time.
      \li \l{lottietoqml} and \l{VectorImage} backend are no longer tech preview.
      \li \l{VectorImage}: Added support for animating shapes along paths.
      \li \l{VectorImage}: Added support for morphing animations (interpolating between two shapes.)
      \li \l{VectorImage}: Added support for matte layers.
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Multimedia Module
    \list
      \li Added callback-based overloads for the start methods of \l{QAudioSource} and \l{QAudioSink} to
          allow real-time audio processing.
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Network Module
    \list
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Protobuf Module
    \list
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt QML Module
    \list
        \li Added workspace support in QML Language Server.
        \li Added go to C++ definition support in QML Language Server.
        \li Added support to silence context property warnings via a \c{.contextProperties.ini} configuration file for qmllint.
        \li Introduced \c{override} and \c{virtual} keywords which, together with the existing \c{final} keyword and tooling support,
            help prevent accidental property shadowing and allow explicit property overriding in QML.
            See \l{qtqml-syntax-overridesemantics.html}{Property Shadowing and Override Semantics} for details.
        \li Gave the \l easingCurve value type a name and transformed the
            \l Easing namespace into a singleton.
        \li Added APIs to QQmlContext to get the \l{QQmlContext::childContexts()}
            {list of child contexts} and to \l{QQmlContext::findObjectRecursively()}{find an object
            by id}.
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Quick Module
    \list
      \li Added CMAKE command \l{qt_target_qml_from_svg()} for converting from SVG to QML at build
          time.
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Quick Controls Module
    \list
    \li Added \l DoubleSpinBox, which is similar to \l SpinBox but supports
        floating-point values.
    \li Added \l {DialogButtonBox::}{defaultButton} and
        \l {DialogButtonBox::}{defaultStandardButton} to \l DialogButtonBox.
        When set, the respective button will be highlighted and receive
        activeFocus whenever the DialogButtonBox gets focus.
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Quick Dialogs Module
    \list
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Quick Effects Module
    \list
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Quick 3D Module
    \list
        \li Added QML API for user-defined render passes, enabling custom rendering pipelines
            directly in QML without C++ knowledge
        \li Added \l{ExtendedSceneEnvironment::ssrEnabled}{ssrEnabled} property in
            \l{ExtendedSceneEnvironment} to enable screen-space reflections (SSR)
        \li Added screen-space global illumination (SSGI) effect to
            \l{ExtendedSceneEnvironment}, providing ambient occlusion and real-time indirect
            lighting
        \li Added per-object motion vector generation for Temporal AA and motion blur effects
        \li Added layering support to allow grouping nodes and controlling which layers the
            camera renders
        \li Added linked list order-independent transparency (OIT) rendering method
        \li Added \c{NORMAL_ROUGHNESS_TEXTURE} support in post-processing effects and custom
            materials
        \li Added blue noise sampling to PCF soft shadows for improved quality with less
            visible noise patterns
        \li Added proper handling of pre-multiplied alpha for Qt Quick content in textures
        \li Added \c{VIEW_MATRIX} and \c{PROJECTION_MATRIX} exposure to post-processing
            effects
        \li Added \l{QQuick3DViewport::pickInRect}{pickInRect()} method in
            \l{QQuick3DViewport} for rectangle-based object selection
        \li Added \l{View3D::closestPointPick}{closestPointPick()} method in \l{View3D} to
            find the closest point on a surface to a given point
        \li Added \l{View3D::rayPick}{rayPick()} overload that accepts a specific model
            parameter
        \li Added scene shape for particle emitters that dynamically calculates shapes based
            on scene geometry
        \li Added \l{QQuick3DTextureProviderExtension} API for simplified custom texture
            provider creation
        \li Added \l{QSSGFrameData::scheduleRenderResults}{scheduleRenderResults()} function
            in \l{QSSGFrameData} to request specific render pass results
        \li Updated Assimp to v6.0.2
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Quick 3D XR Module
    \list
        \li Added OpenGL desktop Linux support (Monado, Xlib, Wayland platforms)
        \li Extended \l{XrView::processTouch}{processTouch()} to deliver touch events to any
            pickable \l{Model}, not just \l{XrItem}
        \li Enhanced \l{XrView::touchpointState}{touchpointState()} to return surface position
            and normal vector information for 3D touch interactions
        \li Added Popup and Menu support in \l{XrItem} through dedicated QQuickOverlay
        \li Updated OpenXR to v1.1.49
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Quick 3D Physics Module
    \list
    \endlist

    \section2 Qt Quick VectorImage Module
    \list
      \li Added support for SVG masks.
      \li Added support for SVG post-processing filters to match the support in \l{Qt SVG}:
          feGaussianBlur, feColorMatrix, feOffset, feFlood, feBlend, feComposite and feMerge.
      \li Added support for animating shapes along paths.
      \li Added support for the SVG <symbol> tag.
    \endlist

