    \endlist

    \section2 Mobile Platforms

    \section3 Android

    \section4 Qt for Android
    \list
    \li Qt Jenny now supports implementing Java interfaces and extending Java classes in C++.
    \li Support for Play Store's Feature Delivery.
    \endlist

    \section4 Qt Quick for Android
    \list
    \li Added QtQuickView.invokeMethod() for calling QML functions from Java/Kotlin.
    \endlist

    \section3 iOS
    \list
    \li Added support for file icons in the platform theme.
    \li Added support for QFileOpenEvent for external requests to open files.
    \li Sandboxed applications can now access files outside of the application
        sandbox (so called security scoped resources) for both reading and writing.
        Files or folders chosen by the user via file dialogs or similar native mechanism
        are automatically and transparently handled, including persistent access across
        application and device restarts.
    \li Added support for native save dialogs.
    \endlist

